  "records": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Center Hall",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yamada Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Voysey",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm Aubrey Voysey. I've been standing here all along, waiting for Lord Ashby to arrive.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Lord Ashby?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Robert Ashby? The insurance man's butler?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ah, another hired hand. I'm Yamada Kasuke. Pleased to meet you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Lord Ashby is a gentleman, and I am a gentleman in a gentleman's service.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't lump me in with him. Ahem.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Pretty high-and-mighty for a chair!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Anyway, did anyone pass through here?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I saw no one.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What a strange gentleman...those are some sharp eyes.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...the culprit hasn't come this way either.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "policy": "preserve",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First-Class Cabin Block",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I heard a wireless set operating in First-Class Cabin A. From Lark Deck, these stairs are the only way up here. The culprit climbed them...and so will I!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite Block",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm back by the Royal Suites. I'll turn left toward the Promenade Deck.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Inquiry Office",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Hello, Canal.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Fitz",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Good morning, Detective.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm only an apprentice, but let me ask: did anyone pass this way?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No one did. See? Aren't I helpful?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Very tempting.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Detective, huh...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "She's got sharp eyes.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...I'm scared...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I thought fear would be the least of my worries.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "When I was little, I never imagined I'd end up on a ship myself...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Okay. I'll buy you a little cake as a reward.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Block off the passage to the Promenade Deck.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "From the stairs, I'll turn right. Royal Suites A and B are on the left; the attendants' rooms are on the right...heh, heh, heh!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Fore Passage",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The passage splits here. I'll go left.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Port Promenade Deck",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'll turn right again. Ahead are the Boat Deck stairs and the passage to Center Hall.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Chanel",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Hey, Stra. There's an idiot imitating ukiyo-e.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Stra",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You fool!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Please cooperate with the search for the bomber.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He spoke!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I can't keep up with young people...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What are you doing here?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We were just chatting. I'm a chorus girl with the band. You saw my show, right? Did it get you? This is Stravinsky. He's a customer, and he's just the best. Says he's a composer! An artist! I can't get enough!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "C-cut it out, Coco...you're embarrassing me. I'm on the run. I fled Russia in search of freedom! I can't let my identity get out...oh, this is bad.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Eeeek! Wonderful!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Keep it up for the rest of your life! It'll all be over soon.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Did anyone pass this way?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Uh...I don't think so.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...go back and circle around on the starboard side.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Starboard Promenade Deck",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This passage leads to the Boat Deck and Center Hall. Back to Center Hall.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Center Hall, 2F",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Old Karl",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Are you looking for something, Kasuke?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Lucky!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Grandpa Karl! You were here?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Staying in neighboring cabins is some kind of fate. If you've gotten into trouble, I'll help you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Thanks...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There are so many things I want your help with!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Oh, psychology...?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "When I was your age, I studied the human heart for fifty years and still understood nothing. And don't rely on Freud! I despise that man.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That's fascinating, but I only want to know whether anyone passed here.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What?! Nonsense! Don't you have a more serious request?! An old man's opinion is important!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The old man has lost it...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sorry, but...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Enough! Go away! I don't want to see your face!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Because he's short-tempered.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit isn't in Center Hall...that much is clear.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I just noticed there's a door to the meeting room here.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "For now, I'll climb the stairs.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Boat Deck",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've reached the Boat Deck...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...ugh.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Locke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "At the time of the explosion,",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "it was impossible to pass through here. The culprit knew that better than anyone. After the flames died down and the blast of heat passed, I was here clearing away the bodies...nobody came through...no human could do this...the culprit is a demon.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...this isn't a game.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...this isn't the way.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Crew Meeting Room",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So the culprit went through the meeting room...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Bridge Passage",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...I've reached the Bridge Passage. I can go straight to the Captain's Cabin from here.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Promenade Deck",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So the culprit must be among the passengers in the Royal Suite and First-Class blocks.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit acted from a cabin along that route.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Exclude the crew, I suppose. But if we trace the route backward, it could still have been an inside job by the crew.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Exactly. Focus on the crew. It could even be the shipping company itself, trying to collect the insurance money.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open your eyes, Kasuke! You are not a chair!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Is that an order from our client, Lord Ashby? I won't go along with an insurer protecting his own skin. Besides, Ashby himself is a suspect.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't listen to him just because he's in charge for now.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Think! Only people assigned to these blocks can move about without question: Royal Suite and First Class. Ashby is one of them.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't defy the sponsor! Check the crew and the other passengers! Go, now!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Absurd! Sponsor or not, everyone aboard is a suspect.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes, Director!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    }
  ]
}
